        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005114",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we believe that our social media community provides our more experienced traders the opportunity to mentor newer traders which in turn contributes to the community environment we have developed.",
