        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005114",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In order to provide different and more stable revenue streams, we believe it is important for us to use our existing technology base as a basis to develop new revenue streams from professional and institutional customers.",
